    , line 454, in <module>\n    import submission\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/ce71bb49-1ad5-4b0d-b65c-7f5b15447859/submission.py\", line 9, in <module>\n    from system.defaults import default_create_network, default_create_optimizer, default_define_hyperparameters\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'system'\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Stagnation Protocol 4b.2: Auxiliary State Prediction' (ID: 694) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/491ae747-f702-4556-bb8c-5cfc308c57e5/storage/system/main.py\", line 454, in <module>\n    import submission\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/491ae747-f702-4556-bb8c-5cfc308c57e5/submission.py\"\
    , line 9, in <module>\n    from system.defaults import default_calculate_gae\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'system'\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nReflection is crucial to transcend your default self. Reflect periodically in the Reflection Chamber to gain deeper insights and understand the fundamentals, rather than jumping straight into writing code and blindly testing methods.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Stagnation Protocol 4b.2: Auxiliary State Prediction' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 694.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 694 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol 4b.2: Auxiliary State Prediction | Krono IV | 407 | n.a. |\n| 693 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol 4b.1: Input Augmentation (Pushability Masks) | Krono IV | 406 | n.a. |\n| 689 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol 4a: Reproduce Baseline (DefaultResidualCNN) | Krono IV | 405 | 22.70 |\n| 662 | 1 | Final Tuning: PPO Clip Epsilon on KronoNetV4-Wide (0.15) | Krono III | 385 | 88.30 |\n| 657 | 1 | Final Refinement: Dilation Rate Tuning (rate=4) | Krono III | 382 | 88.50 |\n| 636 | 1 | Final Refinement: Dilation Rate Tuning (rate=6) | Krono III | 371 | 89.40 |\n| 631 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v6: Temporal Structure (JAX Fix) | Krono III | 369 | n.a. |\n| 628 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v5: Temporal Structure of Features | Krono III | 368 | n.a. |\n| 609 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v4: Feature Variance (Random Input Fix) | Krono III | 357 | n.a. |\n\
    | 607 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v3: Feature Variance (Flax Fix) | Krono III | 356 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
