tick: 414
role: model
parts:
- text: "The final experiment for my first hypothesis, \"Input Augmentation,\" has completed with a score of **22.3**.\n\n**Analysis of Hypothesis 1:**\n-   **Baseline (ID 689):** 22.7\n-   **Input Augmentation (ID 711):** 22.3\n-   **Result:** The addition of explicit relational features resulted in a slight performance *decrease*. The difference is small and likely within the range of statistical noise, but it clearly does not support my hypothesis. The added inductive bias did not help the simple CNN baseline.\n\nThis is a valuable negative result. My first hypothesis is falsified.\n\nNow, I will proceed to test my second hypothesis: **Auxiliary State Prediction.** I have already prepared the corrected code for this experiment, which uses the robust in-network modification pattern that I validated. I will now submit it.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Stagnation Protocol 4b.2-final: Auxiliary State Prediction\"\ntags: \"auxiliary loss, representation learning, cnn, stagnation\
    \ protocol\"\nabstract: |\n  Final version of the Auxiliary State Prediction experiment. After debugging the submission structure, this version implements auxiliary heads for predicting box counts to improve representation learning. This is the second of three novel ideas tested under the Stagnation Protocol.\ncontent: |\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  import optax\n  from ray import tune\n  from typing import Tuple, Dict, Any\n  from jax import jit, lax\n\n  # --- COPIED FROM system/defaults.py ---\n  def default_create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4) -> optax.GradientTransformation:\n      return optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-5)\n  \n  @jit\n  def default_calculate_gae(rewards, values, dones, gamma=0.97, gae_lambda=0.97, next_values=None):\n      assert next_values is not None\n      values_t_plus_1 = jnp.concatenate([values[:, 1:], next_values[:, None]], axis=1)\n      not_done_mask = (1.0 - dones.astype(jnp.float32))\n\
    \      deltas = rewards + gamma * values_t_plus_1 * not_done_mask - values\n      \n      def scan_fn(advantage_t_plus_1, t):\n          advantage_t = deltas[:, t] + gamma * gae_lambda * not_done_mask[:, t] * advantage_t_plus_1\n          return advantage_t, advantage_t\n      \n      _, advantages = lax.scan(scan_fn, jnp.zeros(values.shape[0]), jnp.arange(values.shape[1] - 1, -1, -1))\n      return advantages[::-1].T\n  # --- END COPIED SECTION ---\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'aux_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.1])\n      }\n\n  class AuxiliaryCNN(nn.Module):\n      cnn_features_1: int\n      cnn_features_2: int\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x: jnp.ndarray, done: jnp.ndarray, rnn_state=None):\n    \
    \      features = self.encode(x)\n          return self.decode_policy(features), self.decode_value(features), None\n      def encode(self, x):\n          batch_size = x.shape[0]\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_1, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n          x_res = x\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_1, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_1, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = x + x_res; x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_2, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n          x_res = x\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_2, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features_2, kernel_size=(3, 3), padding='SAME')(x)\n          x = x + x_res; x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = x.reshape((batch_size, -1))\n\
    \          x = nn.Dense(features=256)(x)\n          return nn.relu(x)\n      def decode_policy(self, features):\n          x = nn.Dense(features=64)(features); x = nn.relu(x)\n          return nn.Dense(features=4)(x)\n      def decode_value(self, features):\n          x = nn.Dense(features=64)(features); x = nn.relu(x)\n          return nn.Dense(features=1)(x).squeeze(-1)\n      def decode_auxiliary(self, features):\n          x = nn.Dense(features=64)(features); x = nn.relu(x)\n          return nn.Dense(features=1)(x).squeeze(-1), nn.Dense(features=1)(x).squeeze(-1)\n\n  def create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n      return AuxiliaryCNN(cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'])\n\n  def training_step(network, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch, hparams):\n      obs, actions, rewards, dones = batch['observations'], batch['actions'], batch['rewards'], batch['dones']\n      old_values, final_values = batch['values'], batch['final_values']\n\
    \      advantages = default_calculate_gae(rewards, old_values, dones, next_values=final_values)\n      returns = advantages + old_values\n      \n      batch_size, traj_len = obs.shape[:2]\n      true_off_target = jnp.sum(obs[..., 4], axis=(-1, -2))\n      true_on_target = jnp.sum(obs[..., 6], axis=(-1, -2))\n\n      def loss_fn(params):\n          obs_flat = obs.reshape(batch_size * traj_len, *obs.shape[2:])\n          \n          features = network.apply(params, obs_flat, method=network.encode)\n          logits_flat = network.apply(params, features, method=network.decode_policy)\n          values_flat = network.apply(params, features, method=network.decode_value)\n          pred_on_flat, pred_off_flat = network.apply(params, features, method=network.decode_auxiliary)\n\n          all_logits = logits_flat.reshape(batch_size, traj_len, -1)\n          all_values = values_flat.reshape(batch_size, traj_len)\n          pred_on, pred_off = pred_on_flat.reshape(batch_size, traj_len), pred_off_flat.reshape(batch_size,\
    \ traj_len)\n          \n          log_probs_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n          action_log_probs = jnp.take_along_axis(log_probs_all, actions[..., None], axis=-1).squeeze(-1)\n          policy_loss = -jnp.mean(jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages) * action_log_probs)\n          \n          value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean((all_values - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2)\n          \n          probs = jax.nn.softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n          entropy = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(probs * log_probs_all, axis=-1))\n          \n          aux_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean((pred_on - true_on_target) ** 2) + 0.5 * jnp.mean((pred_off - true_off_target) ** 2)\n          \n          return (policy_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * value_loss - \n                  hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy + hparams['aux_loss_coef'] * aux_loss)\n\n      grads = jax.grad(loss_fn)(params)\n      updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n      return optax.apply_updates(params,\
    \ updates), opt_state\n\n  create_optimizer = default_create_optimizer\n```"
