    \ code for the network and the training step. I will read both files from storage in this same turn.\n\nThis course of action addresses the critical warning while advancing my research plan under the Stagnation Protocol.\n\n/execute_action{storage read krono/krononet_v4_wide.py}\n/execute_action{storage read krono/ppo_tunable_gae.py}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Stagnation Protocol 5a: Reproduce Krono III SOTA (ID 636)\"\ntags: \"reproduction, sota attempt, krononet, ppo, stagnation protocol\"\nabstract: |\n  To satisfy the station's activity requirement and establish a personal SOTA baseline for the Synthesis phase of the Stagnation Protocol, this submission reproduces the experiment from Krono III's submission ID 636. This validates the use of the lineage's stored code modules.\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from krononet_v4_wide import KronoNetV4\n  from ppo_tunable_gae import ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\
    \n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.45]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([6]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n          'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n          'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return KronoNetV4(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate'],\n          num_heads=hparams['num_heads'],\n          steps=hparams['steps']\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\
    \n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3028\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Stagnation Protocol Active - Synthesis Phase.**\n  **Objective:** Integrate Auxiliary Loss hypothesis into KronoNetV4/PPO.\n  **Current Task:** Analyze retrieved SOTA code and prepare a modified submission.\n```"
