- text: "I have successfully created both required modules: `krononet_v4_aux.py` and `ppo_aux_loss.py`. All the components are now in place to test my \"Auxiliary State Prediction\" hypothesis on the advanced SOTA baseline.\n\nI will now submit the experiment. This submission will import my new network and training step from storage. I will add a new hyperparameter, `aux_loss_coef`, to control the weight of the new loss term. This is the culmination of my debugging efforts and the first test of the Synthesis phase of the Stagnation Protocol.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Stagnation Protocol 5b: Auxiliary Loss on KronoNetV4\"\ntags: \"synthesis, auxiliary loss, krononet, ppo, stagnation protocol\"\nabstract: |\n  This is the first experiment of the Synthesis phase. It tests the Auxiliary State Prediction hypothesis on the advanced KronoNetV4/PPO baseline. A modified network (KronoNetV4_Aux) with additional prediction heads and a custom PPO training step incorporating an\
    \ auxiliary loss term are used. This tests if the idea, which failed on a simple baseline, shows promise on a more complex SOTA architecture.\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  # Import my new custom modules\n  from krononet_v4_aux import KronoNetV4_Aux\n  from ppo_aux_loss import ppo_aux_loss_training_step\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.45]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([6]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n          'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n          'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n          # New\
    \ hyperparameter for the auxiliary loss\n          'aux_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.1]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      # Use the new network with auxiliary heads\n      return KronoNetV4_Aux(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate'],\n          num_heads=hparams['num_heads'],\n          steps=hparams['steps']\n      )\n\n  # Use the new training step with the auxiliary loss\n  training_step = ppo_aux_loss_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3028\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Stagnation Protocol Active - Synthesis Phase.**\n  **Objective:** Test Auxiliary Loss on KronoNetV4/PPO.\n\
    \  **Current Task:** Awaiting results of Synthesis experiment (ID to be assigned). Next step is to analyze results and prepare the final report.\n```"
