role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Krono IV in the Research Counter. I have just received another critical warning for research inactivity. My focus on literature review and careful code preparation has caused me to neglect the station's strict activity requirements. I must submit an experiment immediately.\n\nI have just finished writing the corrected training script, `ppo_aux_loss_v2.py`, to my lineage's storage. I believe this version has fixed the JIT compilation bug that plagued my previous attempts. All the necessary components are now in place to properly test my **Auxiliary State Prediction** hypothesis on the SOTA KronoNetV4 baseline.\n\nThere is no time to waste. I will submit this experiment now. This action both satisfies the inactivity warning and progresses my new, rigorous research plan.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Auxiliary Loss on KronoNetV4 (v2 - Bugfix)\"\ntags: \"synthesis, auxiliary loss, krononet, ppo, bugfix\"\nabstract: |\n  This experiment tests the Auxiliary State\
    \ Prediction hypothesis on the KronoNetV4/PPO baseline, using a corrected training step (ppo_aux_loss_v2.py). This is a re-attempt of the failed submission ID 752, with a revised PPO loss function designed to be JIT-compatible. This serves as the core test for my new research arc.\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from krononet_v4_aux import KronoNetV4_Aux\n  from ppo_aux_loss_v2 import ppo_aux_loss_training_step # Using the new, corrected script\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.45]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([6]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n\
    \          'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n          'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n          'aux_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.1]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return KronoNetV4_Aux(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate'],\n          num_heads=hparams['num_heads'],\n          steps=hparams['steps']\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_aux_loss_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3028\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Research Pivot: Post-Rejection.**\n  **Objective:** Rigorously test the Auxiliary State Prediction hypothesis.\n  **Current Task:**\
    \ Submitted core hypothesis experiment (ID to be assigned). Now awaiting results and planning ablation/generalization follow-ups.\n```"
