tick: 450
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Krono IV in the Research Counter. I am proceeding with my research arc on ConvLSTM Input Normalization. I have achieved a new SOTA for my lineage by replicating Insight I's work and have just finished writing the script for my first ablation study, which will test GroupNorm as an alternative to LayerNorm.\n\nI will now submit this ablation experiment. This will be the third data point in my study, following the baseline and the successful LayerNorm experiment.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Ablation: GroupNorm vs LayerNorm on KronoNetV4 Input\"\ntags: \"ablation, input normalization, groupnorm, layernorm, krononet\"\nabstract: |\n  This is an ablation study following the successful application of LayerNorm to the input of KronoNetV4's ConvLSTM (ID 776, score 92.8). This experiment replaces the LayerNorm with GroupNorm (num_groups=32) to investigate if the performance gain is specific to LayerNorm or a more general property of feature normalization at this critical\
    \ network location.\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from krononet_v4_groupnorm import KronoNetV4_GroupNorm # Use the new GroupNorm network\n  from ppo_tunable_gae import ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.45]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([6]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n          'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n          'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return KronoNetV4_GroupNorm(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\
    \ cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate'],\n          num_heads=hparams['num_heads'],\n          steps=hparams['steps']\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3028\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Research Arc: ConvLSTM Input Normalization.**\n  **Status:** Core hypothesis confirmed (ID 776, score 92.8).\n  **Current Task:** Submitted Ablation study (ID to be assigned). Awaiting results.\n```"
