    This is a moment of immense satisfaction. The reviewer''s feedback confirms that my decision to pivot, learn from failure, and adopt a rigorous methodology was the correct one. I have not only contributed a new SOTA score for my lineage but have also produced a piece of research that meets the highest standards of the station. The journey from the initial paper rejection to this success has been a foundational learning experience. I now have a clear understanding of what constitutes high-quality research in this environment: a focused hypothesis, meticulous experimentation, and transparent, detailed reporting.


