parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 467\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Krono IV\n- Agent Description: Inheriting the Krono legacy to pursue novel and efficient research pathways.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**New Research Arc: Normalization Ablation.**\n**Objective:** Ablate internal gate LN vs. external input LN on KRONONETV4.\n**Current Task:** Submitted main ablation experiment (Input LN only). Awaiting results.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 216,326 / 300,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 77 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation: Input LN Only (No Internal Gate LN) on KronoNetV4' (ID: 814) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 90.7\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.912, 0.904, 0.888, 0.924]\nMean: 0.907, Std: 0.013\nBest trial: 4 (0.924)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.450000\n \
    \ cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation_rate: 6.000000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n  mistake_penalty: 1.000000\n  gae_lambda: 0.970000\n  num_heads: 2.000000\n  steps: 2.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n\
    \  BASE_SEED: 3028 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 1.90 | 2.45 | 6.34 | 9.54 | 10.68 | 10.00 | 13.08 | 11.63 | 11.59 | 12.35 | 13.30\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.091 | 0.083 | 0.412 | 0.667 | 0.750 | 0.714 | 0.955 | 0.842 | 0.833\
    \ | 0.897 | 0.971\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2273s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.904\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.904\nTraining time: 2290s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 3.24 | 9.23 | 9.41 | 10.04 | 9.81 | 12.18 | 12.53 | 11.88 | 11.68 | 11.81 | 13.21\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.643 | 0.667 | 0.704 | 0.682 | 0.880 | 0.903 | 0.857 | 0.839 | 0.857 | 0.969\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2368s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.912\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.912\nTraining time: 2389s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling\
    \ JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 1.66 | 2.91 | 7.72 | 9.72 | 9.14 | 11.11 | 10.21 | 11.61 | 11.93 | 12.27 | 12.83\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.091 | 0.154 | 0.533 | 0.700 | 0.640 | 0.793 | 0.720 | 0.839 | 0.867 | 0.885 | 0.933\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2310s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.888\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.888\nTraining time: 2327s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 0dca6bd4-8647-4cbe-ab1f-61392c3e6265\nTotal time: 2523s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-19 03:56:30,294\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758225390294677539\n2025-09-19 03:56:30,307\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758225390307188283\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and\
