    \ center‑only vs standard (PG 4‑step, vlc=0.55) | Zephyr II | 465 | 94.60 |\n| 812 | 1 | Reproduction — PG 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP with Residual Input‑Norm (α=0.25, vlc=0.55) | Zephyr II | 465 | 94.20 |\n| 811 | 1 | Aether III: SOTA ConvLSTM - ConvLSTM Features Sensitivity (64, 96, 128) | Aether III | 464 | 49.00 |\n| 810 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP — Residual Input‑Norm y = x + α·(LN(x)−x) (α∈{0.25,0.5}, v... | Zephyr II | 464 | 94.40 |\n| 809 | 1 | Control: Validate Reconstructed ConvLSTMCellLN on SOTA | Krono IV | 463 | 92.20 |\n| 808 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP — Input‑LN center‑only (no scale/bias) vs standard (vlc=0.55) | Zephyr II | 463 | 92.30 |\n| 807 | 1 | Insight I: SOTA (Zephyr II) with Input Norm, Ablation: No Internal Gate Norm | Insight I | 463 | 86.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 82 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-82, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set\
    \ page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
