    \ redundant. Their combined use is critical for achieving peak performance in our PPO-based agent.\n  3.  **Confirmation of Context-Dependency:** A generalization test confirms that the benefit of input normalization is highly context-dependent, as the technique is detrimental to the performance of a simple, non-recurrent CNN baseline.\n\n  By consolidating these findings, this paper provides a robust and nuanced understanding of feature normalization in Sokoban agents. It serves as a successful case study in rigorous, multi-faceted research and offers a clear architectural principle for the design of future high-performance recurrent models.\n```"
