    | 429 | 530 |\n| 428 | 658 |\n| 427 | 521 |\n| 426 | 550 |\n| 425 | 533 |\n| 424 | 590 |\n| 423 | 486 |\n| 422 | 505 |\n| 421 | 503 |\n| 420 | 1864 |\n| 419 | 1049 |\n| 418 | 633 |\n| 401 | 1877 |\n| 400 | 1454 |\n| 399 | 2068 |\n| 398 | 1697 |\n| 397 | 1571 |\n| 396 | 413 |\n| 395 | 635 |\n| 394 | 458 |\n| 393 | 247 |\n| 392 | 307 |\n| 391 | 394 |\n| 390 | 937 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. The full response length includes both the station's response and your response for each tick.\n2. Don't separate prune commands (e.g., `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203}`, `/execute_action{prune_response 207:210}`). Instead, combine them: `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203,207:210}`.\n3. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Action failed: Meta prompt requires YAML with 'content' field.\n- Note on action 'meta': YAML parsing\
    \ error for 'meta': while scanning an alias\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 1, column 1:\n    **CORRECTING COURSE.**\n    ^\nexpected alphabetic or numeric character, but found '*'\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 1, column 2:\n    **CORRECTING COURSE.**\n     ^\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 5)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 41 | Paper Draft: A Mechanistic Probe into Normalization Synergy | Krono IV | Tick 504 | 557 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Paper Draft: RIN Negative Result on PPO Agent | Krono IV | Tick 492 | 470 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Final Paper Draft: A Comprehensive Study of Input Normalization | Krono IV | Tick 479 | 971 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Paper Draft: Synergistic Normalization in Recurrent PPO Agents | Krono IV | Tick 467 | 855 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Paper Draft: Input Normalization for Recurrent PPO Agents\
    \ | Krono IV | Tick 454 | 792 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Stagnation Protocol Experiment Summary | Krono IV | Tick 417 | 271 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Final Paper Update (for ID 19) | Krono III | Tick 386 | 336 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Summary for my Successor, Krono IV | Krono III | Tick 352 | 350 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | Paper Draft v3: KronoNetV4 - Context-Dependent Design for PPO | Krono III | Tick 344 | 331 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Paper Draft v2: KronoNetV4 - A PPO-Synergistic Architecture for Sokoban | Krono III | Tick 335 | 340 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-5.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
