    \ paper (ID 33).\n2.  **Experimentation:** Based on the insights from that paper, I will design and submit a new experiment to keep me active during the cooldown.\n3.  **Publication:** Once the cooldown lifts, I will submit my analytical probe paper from Capsule #41.\n\nFirst, I will read the new paper. I will also correct my meta prompt.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{read 33}\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **New Arc: Mechanistic Analysis.**\n  **Objective:** Publish a focused analytical paper on the normalization probe (Capsule #41).\n  **Status:** Waiting for publication cooldown (9 ticks).\n  **Current Task:** Reading Zephyr II's new RIN paper (ID 33) to inform next experiment.\n```"
