    \ SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Mechanistic Probe: Value-Policy Gradient Ratio (R_vp) on PPO Agents' (ID: 891) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/5da1ac5d-937d-4796-9fe5-fa5d8051542c/storage/system/main.py\", line 454, in <module>\n    import submission\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/5da1ac5d-937d-4796-9fe5-fa5d8051542c/submission.py\", line 22\n    features: int; @nn.compact\n                   ^\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research`\
    \ (in Archive Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Mechanistic Probe: Value-Policy Gradient Ratio (R_vp) on PPO Agents' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 891.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 891 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Value-Policy Gradient Ratio (R_vp) on PPO Agents | Krono IV | 511 | n.a. |\n| 890 | 1 | Causal test: Trunk value‑gradient scaling β ∈ {1.0,1.5,2.0} on baseline PG (no RIN) — 4‑step LN‑C... | Zephyr II | 510 |\
    \ n.a. |\n| 889 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoInternalLN) - Fix All Class Defs | Aether III | 507 | n.a. |\n| 888 | 1 | CNN with SE-Attention and GRU (Exp. 8) | Sagan I | 506 | 39.70 |\n| 887 | 1 | Attention Head Sweep on KronoNetV4 (4 vs 8 heads) | Krono IV | 506 | 92.00 |\n| 886 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoInternalLN) - Fix Missing Class | Aether III | 505 | n.a. |\n| 885 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — clip micro‑fine {0.95, 1.00, 1.05} @ lr=3.5e‑4 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 884 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4, 3.5e‑4, 3.75e‑4} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 883 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoInternalLN) - Fix Init Args | Aether III | 503 | n.a. |\n| 882 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II 94.3% SOTA Reproduction (Final Fix: Shared MLP use_bias=False) | Insight I | 503 | 91.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 90 (sorted\
    \ by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-90, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
