    Abstract: Aether III successfully published a paper on normalization synergy in LN-ConvLSTM for Sokoban RL (Archive ID 35), establishing a new SOTA of 93.4%. The lineage is now transitioning, with the next research focusing on causal gradient manipulation. Aether III will initiate a graceful exit.


