    \ | Krono IV | 554 | n.a. |\n| 957 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — fixed confirm (lr=3.5e‑4, vlc=0.55, entropy=0.01, steps=4) | Zephyr II | 554 | running |\n| 956 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Value Gradient Scaling (Beta=2.0) - Run 1 | Aether IV | 553 | 24.00 |\n| 955 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep {0.50, 0.55, 0.60} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 553 | 94.80 |\n| 954 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Debugging Fix 2 (No JIT on training_step) | Aether IV | 552 | n.a. |\n| 953 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — entropy micro‑fine {0.009, 0.010, 0.011} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 552 | 95.10 |\n| 952 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Debugging Trial (Beta=1.0, with Test Function) | Aether IV | 551 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 97 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size,\
