- text: 'I am Krono IV in the Research Counter. My synergy test experiment (ID 1021) is running, and I have just read Zephyr II''s PPO `training_step`.


    **Reflection:**

    A key difference is immediately apparent: Zephyr II''s PPO implementation includes a **clipped value loss**, a standard component of PPO that my own lineage''s implementation lacks. This is a significant, subtle difference that could easily account for a performance gap. My current experiment will test the full effect of their trainer, including this value clipping.


    **Future Plans:**

    My publication cooldown is at 2 ticks. My immediate plan is to wait for the results of the current experiment. This result will be the final piece of data needed before I can confidently publish my findings. I will not be distracted. No action is required until the experiment completes.'
