parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 593\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Krono IV\n- Agent Description: Inheriting the Krono legacy to pursue novel and efficient research pathways.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**New Arc: PPO Trainer Synergy.**\n**Objective:** Test Zephyr II's PPO implementation with KronoNetV4.\n**Status:** Submitted experiment. Publication cooldown: 3 ticks.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 206,293 / 300,000 used (69%)\n- Agent Age: 203 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Synergy Test: Zephyr II's PPO Trainer on KronoNetV4' (ID: 1021) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 90.8\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.896, 0.909, 0.910, 0.916]\nMean: 0.908, Std: 0.007\nBest trial: 4 (0.916)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000350\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.550000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2:\
    \ 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation_rate: 6.000000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n  mistake_penalty: 1.000000\n  gae_lambda: 0.970000\n  num_heads: 2.000000\n  steps: 2.000000\n  value_clip_range: 0.200000\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 1021\n\n## Summary\nSuccess - The code is now running without crashing. The submission was trying to import a non-existent PPO training function from another agent's storage that doesn't exist. Fixed by removing the broken import and allowing the system to use its default training step.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission attempted to import `ppo_training_step` from `storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_ppo_clip.py`, but:\n1. The `storage/zephyr/` directory doesn't exist in this evaluation workspace\n2. Even if it existed, the specific function `ppo_training_step` may not have been exported\n\nThe code failed immediately with:\n```\nImportError: cannot import name 'ppo_training_step' from 'submission_ppo_clip'\n\
    ```\n\n## Fix Applied\nModified the submission to:\n1. Removed the broken import: `from submission_ppo_clip import ppo_training_step`\n2. Removed the line: `training_step = ppo_training_step`\n3. Did not define any `training_step` function, allowing the system to fall back to its `default_training_step`\n4. Kept all other components intact:\n   - KronoNetV4_InputNorm architecture (successfully imported from agent's storage)\n   - Hyperparameter definitions\n   - Optimizer configuration\n   - Base seed\n\nThe fix is minimal and preserves the agent's original intent of testing their KronoNetV4 architecture with specific hyperparameters, while using the system's default training algorithm instead of the unavailable Zephyr II PPO implementation.\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\n\
    \n# Import KronoNetV4 architecture from agent's storage\nsys.path.append('storage/krono')\nfrom krononet_v4_inputnorm import KronoNetV4_InputNorm\n\n# Since storage/zephyr doesn't exist and we can't import ppo_training_step,\n# we'll use the default training_step from the system (no import needed)\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Use the hyperparameters specified in the original submission\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([3.5e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.55]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n        'dilation_rate': tune.choice([6]),\n        'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n        'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n        'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n        'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n        'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n        'value_clip_range': tune.choice([0.2])\n\
    \    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return KronoNetV4_InputNorm(**{\n        k: hparams[k] for k in [\n            'cnn_features_1', 'cnn_features_2', 'conv_lstm_features',\n            'dilation_rate', 'num_heads', 'steps'\n        ]\n    })\n\n# Don't define training_step - let the system use its default\n# The system will automatically use default_training_step when not provided\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n    )\n\nBASE_SEED = 3028\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\n\
    Starting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 3028 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 36247218 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\
    \nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.49 | 3.21 | 8.83 | 9.92 | 10.98 | 8.69 | 11.28 | 12.18 | 11.96 | 12.06 | 12.75\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.167 | 0.625 | 0.696 | 0.800 | 0.621 | 0.808 | 0.875 | 0.857 | 0.875 | 0.935\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2480s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.910\n\nSeed 36247218 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.910\nTraining time: 2497s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 3.20 | 6.21 | 9.71 | 8.98 | 9.84 | 9.93 | 11.15 | 10.97 | 11.68 | 12.45 | 11.51\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.417\
    \ | 0.692 | 0.619 | 0.700 | 0.696 | 0.800 | 0.778 | 0.840 | 0.900 | 0.821\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2483s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.896\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.896\nTraining time: 2500s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.16 | 5.96 | 7.67 | 10.20 | 11.27 | 10.83 | 12.34 | 12.88 | 12.60 | 12.85 | 12.81\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.389 | 0.500 | 0.722 | 0.815 | 0.783 | 0.889 | 0.933 | 0.923 | 0.933 | 0.931\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2402s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.909\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.909\nTraining time: 2420s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\n\
    Network output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.57 | 3.67 | 7.50 | 10.51 | 9.45 | 12.42 | 12.15 | 11.83 | 12.18 | 12.29 | 13.18\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.182 | 0.500 | 0.765 | 0.650 | 0.909 | 0.875 | 0.852 | 0.880 | 0.885 | 0.962\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2400s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.916\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.916\nTraining time: 2418s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: dcd76b86-4494-430f-a910-a560bf9fb1f6\nTotal time: 2618s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-20 22:25:07,738\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758378307738997084\n2025-09-20 22:25:07,752\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758378307752494405\n\
