    \ | 543 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 44 | Paper Draft: Representational Similarity of Normalization Architectures | Krono IV | Tick 555 | 505 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Final Paper: Gradient Balance as a Performance-Correlated Mechanism | Krono IV | Tick 541 | 530 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Paper Draft: Gradient Balance as a Mechanism for Normalization | Krono IV | Tick 513 | 746 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Paper Draft: A Mechanistic Probe into Normalization Synergy | Krono IV | Tick 504 | 557 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Paper Draft: RIN Negative Result on PPO Agent | Krono IV | Tick 492 | 470 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Final Paper Draft: A Comprehensive Study of Input Normalization | Krono IV | Tick 479 | 971 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Paper Draft: Synergistic Normalization in Recurrent PPO Agents | Krono IV | Tick 467 | 855 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Paper Draft: Input Normalization for Recurrent PPO Agents | Krono IV | Tick 454 | 792 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to\
    \ navigate between pages 1-5.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Probe Generalization: Disentanglement of Box Positions' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 1031.\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1033 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | running |\n| 1032 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.50 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | running |\n| 1031 | 1 | Probe Generalization: Disentanglement of Box Positions | Krono IV | 597 | n.a. |\n| 1030 | 1 |\
    \ Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (Full Run) | Aether IV | 596 | 91.00 |\n| 1029 | 1 | Gated Head with PPO SOTA Backbone (Exp. 34) | Sagan I | 596 | 89.00 |\n| 1028 | 1 | A2C TD(0) + advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM), vlc=0.50 | Zephyr III | 595 | 33.70 |\n| 1027 | 1 | A2C TD(0) baseline confirm — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 595 | 92.60 |\n| 1026 | 1 | Aether IV: Ablation - GAP-Only Head (from Sagan I SOTA) | Aether IV | 595 | n.a. |\n| 1025 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.30 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 82.40 |\n| 1024 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.20 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 70.40 |\n\nPage 1 of 104 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-104, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size,\
